msgstr "No se pudo leer la conexión guardada."

#: front-end/ad-platforms/views/page.php:161
#: front-end/google-sheets/views/page.php:114
msgid ""
"Your credentials are still stored and have not been deleted, but this site "
"cannot decrypt them. This usually follows a change to the site address, a "
"move to a new server, or new security keys in wp-config.php. Connect again "
"to store a fresh copy."
msgstr ""
"Tus credenciales siguen guardadas y no se han eliminado, pero este sitio no "
"puede descifrarlas. Suele ocurrir tras un cambio en la dirección del sitio, "
"una migración a un servidor nuevo o nuevas claves de seguridad en wp-config."
"php. Vuelve a conectar para guardar una copia nueva."

#: front-end/ad-platforms/views/page.php:169
msgid "Reconnect required"
msgstr "Se requiere volver a conectar"

#: front-end/ad-platforms/views/page.php:171
msgid ""
"The stored authorisation stopped working, so no new spend is being imported. "
"Your existing history is untouched. Connect again to resume syncing."
msgstr ""
"La autorización guardada dejó de funcionar, por lo que no se está importando "
"gasto nuevo. Tu historial existente permanece intacto. Vuelve a conectar "
"para reanudar la sincronización."

#: front-end/ad-platforms/views/page.php:182
msgid ""
"BrikPanel only reads your ad results: total daily spend, impressions and "
"clicks. It never creates, edits or deletes anything in your account."
msgstr ""
"BrikPanel solo lee los resultados de tus anuncios: gasto diario total, "
"impresiones y clics. Nunca crea, edita ni elimina nada en tu cuenta."

#: front-end/ad-platforms/views/page.php:184
msgid ""
"BrikPanel will request read-only access (ads_read) to your Meta ad accounts. "
"We only pull total daily spend, impressions and clicks."
msgstr ""
"BrikPanel solicitará acceso de solo lectura (ads_read) a tus cuentas "
"publicitarias de Meta. Solo importamos el gasto diario total, impresiones y "
"clics."

#: front-end/ad-platforms/views/page.php:204
msgid ""
"Google’s permission screen still asks for broad access (“See, edit, create, "
"and delete your Google Ads accounts and data”) because the Google Ads API "
"has only one permission and offers no read-only option. If you want the "
"permission itself narrowed, connect with a Google account that has Read-only "
"access to the Ads account."
msgstr ""
"La pantalla de permisos de Google sigue pidiendo un acceso amplio («Ver, "
"editar, crear y eliminar tus cuentas y datos de Google Ads») porque la API "
"de Google Ads tiene un único permiso y no ofrece una opción de solo lectura. "
"Si quieres limitar el propio permiso, conecta con una cuenta de Google que "
"tenga acceso de solo lectura a la cuenta de Ads."

