msgstr "Siempre activado"

#: includes/brikpanel-network-access.php:411
msgid "Lock BrikPanel settings on subsites"
msgstr "Bloquear los ajustes de BrikPanel en los subsitios"

#: includes/brikpanel-network-access.php:413
msgid ""
"When on, subsite owners can still use BrikPanel (dashboard, reports, product "
"and coupon tools) but cannot open or change the BrikPanel settings tab. Only "
"the subsites you grant below, and Network Super Admins, may manage BrikPanel "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"Si está activado, los propietarios de subsitios pueden seguir usando "
"BrikPanel (escritorio, informes, herramientas de productos y cupones), pero "
"no pueden abrir ni cambiar la pestaña de ajustes de BrikPanel. Solo los "
"subsitios que autorices abajo y los superadministradores de la red pueden "
"gestionar los ajustes de BrikPanel."

#: includes/brikpanel-network-access.php:418
msgid "Lock the BrikPanel settings tab on subsites"
msgstr "Bloquear la pestaña de ajustes de BrikPanel en los subsitios"

#: includes/brikpanel-network-access.php:425
msgid ""
"Off by default. Turning this on never affects how BrikPanel works elsewhere; "
"it only hides and blocks the settings tab for subsites that are not granted "
"below."
msgstr ""
"Desactivado por defecto. Activarlo nunca cambia cómo funciona BrikPanel en "
"otros sitios; solo oculta y bloquea la pestaña de ajustes para los subsitios "
"que no autorices abajo."

#: includes/brikpanel-network-access.php:432
msgid "Subsites allowed to manage BrikPanel settings"
msgstr "Subsitios autorizados a gestionar los ajustes de BrikPanel"

#: includes/brikpanel-network-access.php:434
msgid ""
"Only used when the lock above is on. Tick a subsite to let its "
"administrators open and change the BrikPanel settings tab on that site. "
"Super Admins always have access regardless of this list."
msgstr ""
"Solo se usa cuando el bloqueo de arriba está activado. Marca un subsitio "
"para permitir que sus administradores abran y cambien la pestaña de ajustes "
"de BrikPanel en ese sitio. Los superadministradores siempre tienen acceso "
"independientemente de esta lista."

