msgid ""
"imported spend covers %1$s to %2$s only. Months outside that range show zero "
"advertising cost because nothing was imported, not because nothing was spent."
msgstr ""
"el gasto importado solo cubre del %1$s al %2$s. Los meses fuera de ese rango "
"muestran coste publicitario cero porque no se importó nada, no porque no se "
